        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/c8a4ac1263a61cf6f7e58009bba39a10.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong>BattleSynth — A Tactical Fantasy Battle Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>BattleSynth</strong>, every fight is a test of your strategy. You don’t just play — you <i>command</i> an army of knights, wizards, assassins, beasts, and strange fantasy creatures, and watch them clash in chaotic, beautiful auto-battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your formation, predict enemy moves, and build the perfect mix of strength, range, and magic. Victory doesn’t always belong to the strongest — sometimes it’s the cleverest who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battles.</strong> Deploy your units wisely and let your formation decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/6072b047a89d4c87599bfd35541163a0.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes.</strong> Every unit type brings its own role — from long-range mages to fearless knights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemies.</strong> No two battles feel the same — adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/9144e31eb69b8c5194c0be5169526b77.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Abilities.</strong> Throw spears, heal allies, or unleash devastating spells at the perfect moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Fantasy Style.</strong> A hand-drawn world where every clash feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/b02979f32d5c6fa88d33c441103c2909.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>BattleSynth</strong> is like fantasy chess — easy to start, hard to master. Combine, experiment, and lead your army to victory in a world where every move counts.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/c8a4ac1263a61cf6f7e58009bba39a10.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong>BattleSynth — A Tactical Fantasy Battle Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>BattleSynth</strong>, every fight is a test of your strategy. You don’t just play — you <i>command</i> an army of knights, wizards, assassins, beasts, and strange fantasy creatures, and watch them clash in chaotic, beautiful auto-battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your formation, predict enemy moves, and build the perfect mix of strength, range, and magic. Victory doesn’t always belong to the strongest — sometimes it’s the cleverest who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battles.</strong> Deploy your units wisely and let your formation decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/6072b047a89d4c87599bfd35541163a0.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes.</strong> Every unit type brings its own role — from long-range mages to fearless knights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemies.</strong> No two battles feel the same — adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/9144e31eb69b8c5194c0be5169526b77.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Abilities.</strong> Throw spears, heal allies, or unleash devastating spells at the perfect moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Fantasy Style.</strong> A hand-drawn world where every clash feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/b02979f32d5c6fa88d33c441103c2909.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>BattleSynth</strong> is like fantasy chess — easy to start, hard to master. Combine, experiment, and lead your army to victory in a world where every move counts.</p>",
